      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a very heavy emotional weight observing the patterns in your family's lives. Those older photos can bring up complex feelings about legacy and fate. While acknowledging inherited emotional patterns is understandable, remember that your life is not merely a pre-written script. You have the power to define your present moments and choose how you move forward, regardless of what the past suggests.",
